&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Everpure (NYSE: P) has evolved from storage pioneer to data platform, closing fiscal 2026 with $3.7 billion in revenue, its first billion-dollar quarter, and accelerating growth into FY27. Our strategic agenda spans the companies defining the next era of technology - hyperscalers, AI labs, the AI hardware supply chain, data platform providers, and the broader AI ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This type of work—work that changes the world—is what the tech industry was founded on. So, if you&#39;re ready to seize the endless opportunities and leave your mark, come join us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE ROLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Everpure is building a global practice for Managed Service Providers from zero: The program, the proposition, and the wins that prove it out. As Senior Solutions Architect, MSP, you&#39;re the technical front line: helping define how Everpure goes to market with MSPs, then taking that straight to the field to win deals. You&#39;ll work shoulder-to-shoulder with MSP architects and their end customers, fluent in cost-per-tenant economics one minute and whiteboarding architecture the next. There&#39;s no playbook yet; you&#39;ll be building it and proving it, deal by deal.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own technical leadership of MSP opportunities end to end: discovery, solution design, sizing, competitive positioning, POCs and technical close.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the end-to-end service architecture — multi-tenancy, automation, provisioning, operational model and integration into the MSP&#39;s existing stack.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Model and influence the commercial construct: unit economics, cost per tenant, Evergreen//One and consumption models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Displace competitors in MSP environments and position the full platform — FlashArray, FlashBlade, Portworx and Everpure Data Intelligence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build technical credibility with MSP architects, practice leads and CTOs, growing a population of partner-side technical champions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Feed real MSP requirements back into the global MSP programme and Product Management, contributing reusable IP — reference architectures, sizing guides, service blueprints — from live engagements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU BRING&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years in pre-sales, solutions architecture or technical leadership, with a demonstrable record of winning partner-led business.&lt;/li&gt;
