&lt;li&gt;Support the creation of press releases, briefings, and other materials for external communications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support coverage monitoring and reporting to be presented to executives and various spokespeople&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Aid the team in creating briefing materials for interviews and conferences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the ongoing management and updating of the corporate website&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct desk research on communication topics and trends to support external communication initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage AI tools and digital automation to enhance efficiency, research, and project management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with designers, contributors, and other internal teams to ensure the timely publication of press materials&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organize team actions and coordinate daily tasks&lt;/li&gt;
